<title>USA: MSC Industrial Direct Q4 pro forma shr up.</title>
<headline>MSC Industrial Direct Q4 pro forma shr up.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINVIEW, N.Y. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MSC Industrial Direct Co., Inc.</p>
<p>			 (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			     13 Wks     14 Wks     52 Wks    53 Wks</p>
<p>			     Ended	 Ended	Ended     Ended</p>
<p>			   8/31/96	 9/2/95   8/31/96    9/2/95</p>
